          ahaMoment: "The 'matkin vs. mafrishin' argument is the key: a single word difference in the mishna is enough to prove that sequestering is not indispensable. If it were, the mishna would say 'they also separate the backup priest.' It doesn't - so sequestering is not invalidating.",
