          ahaMoment: "R. Natan's reading is strikingly physical: the cloud didn't just cover Moses, it transformed his body. Six days of cloud-immersion cleansed him so thoroughly he could go 40 days without food - literally becoming angelic. This is preparation at the cellular level, not just spiritual.",
          learningBlocker: "Students may expect one reading to 'win.' The Gemara presents all three without adjudicating - they are complementary angles on the same question.",
