            speaker: "Ravina",
            text: "Two more practical differences: rivui shiva (wearing the full set of priestly garments on each of the seven inauguration days) and meshicha shiva (anointing on each of the seven days). R. Yochanan holds omitting either invalidates; R. Chanina holds neither does, as neither invalidates ongoing service.",
