          coreTension: "Prophetic lineage (Japheth's descendants will prevail) versus moral accountability (Persians destroy synagogues, so they lose). The Gemara holds both frameworks simultaneously without resolving which wins.",
          coreMove: "Rav introduces a factor that the nation-identification proofs do not account for: current behavior. Even if prophecy favors Persia, their destruction of synagogues creates a deficit that overrides the prophetic trajectory. This is a classic Rabbinic move: moral conduct can redirect prophetic outcomes.",
