            vilna_line: 1, en: "<b>a gatehouse,</b> used to guard the entrance to a courtyard, <b>a portico [<i>akhsadra</i>],</b> an open porch, <b>and a balcony</b> serving as a corridor to several residences. Therefore, <b>the verse states: House; just as a house</b> is a place that <b>is designated for residence</b> and is obligated in the mitzva of <i>mezuza</i>, so too all similar structures are obligated. This is to the <b>exclusion of those</b> structures <b>that are not designated for residence</b> but for other purposes, which are exempt from the mitzva of <i>mezuza</i>.", en_lit: "a gatehouse, a portico [akhsadra], and a balcony the verse states: House; just as a house is designated for residence exclusion of those that are not designated for residence",
