            vilna_line: 1, en: "<b>Rather,</b> must one <b>not conclude from it</b> that that the <i>mishnayot</i> in tractate <i>Middot</i> are in accordance with the opinion of <b>Rabbi Eliezer ben Ya'akov?</b> The Gemara concludes: Indeed, <b>conclude from it</b> that this is so.", en_lit: "Rather, not conclude from it Rabbi Eliezer ben Ya’akov? conclude from it",
