            vilna_line: 2, en: "§ In an additional attempt to resolve the contradiction with regard to the Chamber of the Lambs, <b>Rav Adda, son of Rav Yitzḥak, said: This chamber was removed</b> from the corner, as it was not actually in the corner of the Hall of the Hearth but was located along the middle of the western side of the hall. <b>And</b> therefore, for one <b>who comes from the north,</b> the chamber <b>appears to him</b> to be in the <b>south</b> of the hall; <b>and</b> for one <b>who comes from the south,</b> the chamber <b>appears to him</b> to be in the <b>north</b> of the hall.", en_lit: "Rav Adda, son of Rav Yitzḥak, said: This chamber was removed And who comes from the north, appears to him south and who comes from the south, appears to him north",
