          memoryAnchor: "40 years miracles (Shimon) vs 40 years omens (pre-destruction) - same timeline, inverted meaning.",
          learnerQuestion: "What is the significance of a second forty-year period, this time of decline, appearing in the same baraita tradition?",
          coreTension: "Shimon HaTzaddik's forty years showed favor; the forty years before the destruction showed the same signs in reverse, raising the question of why the Gemara frames decline using the identical timeframe and the identical signs.",
          coreMove: "The baraita reports the lot coming up left, the lamp failing, and the gates opening by themselves, then has Rabban Yochanan ben Zakkai rebuke the gates directly, reading their self-opening as the Temple's own admission of its coming fate, fulfilling Zechariah's prophecy.",
