            vilna_line: 47, en: "<b>In accordance with</b> the opinion of <b>Rabbi Neḥemya, who said</b> that all matters performed in the white garments, even those performed outside the Holy of Holies, are <b>indispensable, everyone agrees that</b> the drawing of the lots <b>is indispensable.</b>", en_lit: "In accordance with Rabbi Neḥemya, who said indispensable, everyone agrees that is indispensable.",
