            vilna_line: 23, en: "§ The Gemara relates: <b>A certain person descended</b> to lead the prayer service on Yom Kippur <b>before Rava</b>. He included the order of the High Priest’s Yom Kippur service in his prayer, and <b>he recited:</b> The High Priest then <b>emerged</b> from the Holy of Holies <b>and placed</b> the bowl <b>on the second golden pedestal in the Sanctuary; he took the blood of the bull</b> from the pedestal <b>and placed the blood of the goat</b> in its place.", en_lit: "A certain person descended before Rava he recited: emerged and placed on the second golden pedestal in the Sanctuary; he took the blood of the bull and placed the blood of the goat",
