          memoryAnchor: "Between dew layers or dissolving at the palm - both images say: manna arrived exactly right.",
          learnerQuestion: "What do the different descriptions of how the manna arrived reveal about its miraculous nature?",
          coreTension: "Between Rav Papa's view (manna sandwiched between two dew layers) and Reish Lakish's view (dak mechusfas - it dissolves instantly at the palm's edge).",
