            speaker: "Baraita",
            text: "The Sages taught: the core confession is at nightfall as Yom Kippur begins. But the Sages added one should also confess before the pre-fast meal, lest the food and drink confuse him afterward. And though he confessed before eating, he confesses again after, in case he sinned during the meal. And he confesses at each prayer - evening, morning, musaf, mincha, and ne'ila - layering confession through the day.",
